# The code surface (docs/code-surface-plan.md): a textarea that numbers its
# logical lines, a wrapped line's continuation unnumbered; the platform's
# monospaced face; a family the app picks from the platform's own list and
# one the platform lacks; a label at twice the platform's size. Every
# expect_gutter but `off` also holds each visible row to its number (G5).
expect_title "codesurface"
expect_gutter textarea@code on
expect_gutter textarea@code shows 1
expect_gutter textarea@code wraps 3
expect_gutter textarea@code hides 40
expect_gutter textarea@plain off
# The end of a document taller than its viewport: the column scrolls with it.
click button@end
expect_focused textarea@code
expect_gutter textarea@code shows 39
expect_gutter textarea@code hides 1
# An edit that adds a line: the new line takes the next number.
press return
type "x"
expect_gutter textarea@code shows 41
expect_face textarea@code monospaced
expect_face textarea@plain proportional
expect_face label@mono monospaced
expect_face entry@mono_entry monospaced
expect_face label@plain_label proportional
# A family the platform does not have falls back to the role (M2).
expect_face label@missing monospaced
# The platform's own list, and a family picked from it (M3).
click button@fonts
expect label@families "families: listed, unique, in order"
expect_face label@picked named
# The multiple of the platform's size (S1).
expect_scaled label@big 2
expect_scaled label@plain_label 1
expect_scaled textarea@code 1
